## Interpretation Guidance

Use this template to produce a governance-grade weekly narrative, not just a metric dump. For each section, include brief interpretation:

- why throughput changed,
- which interruptions were avoidable,
- whether false blocks indicate policy tuning needs,
- whether unsafe attempts indicate prompt quality drift,
- and whether score movement is evidence-backed or estimate-only.

## Required Weekly Closeout Note

Finish every report with a short statement of confidence and top three priorities for next week. This keeps the weekly review actionable for PM planning and allows trend comparison across weeks.

